        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-07-29T04:10:26+09:30" end-time-local="2026-07-29T04:10:26+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-07-28T18:40:26Z" end-time-utc="2026-07-28T18:40:26Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">Showers lingering behind a cold front in Bass Strait will ease this morning. A high pressure system will then move over the Bight today, and will extend a ridge across the state as it slowly moves east into NSW by Saturday. Another cold front is then forecast to cross the state from Saturday evening into Sunday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
